# SRG-APP-000181-AU-000200  -  CAT II
# The Central Log Server must be configured to perform audit reduction that
# supports on-demand reporting requirements.
#
# Generated from the benchmark and the assessment determinations. Edit this
# file to change how this requirement is assessed here; it is read at run
# time. Regenerating overwrites it.

id:              SRG-APP-000181-AU-000200
group:           V-206483
severity:        medium
cat:             CAT II
determination:   APPLICABLE
grade:           C
decidable:       machine
confidence:      tested
cci:             CCI-001876
control_rev5:    AU-7

contribution:    Audit reduction and on-demand reporting are native Splunk search
                 functions; what the application configures is the reporting content itself
                 - saved searches with a defined search string and a bounded dispatch
                 window, supported by search macros, data model acceleration and metric
                 rollup policies.

governs:         savedsearches.conf - Saved searches, scheduled reports and alerts.

check:           savedsearches.conf [<stanza name>] search non_empty
check:           savedsearches.conf [<stanza name>] dispatch.earliest_time present
# --- vendor verification: generated, do not edit by hand
vendor:          savedsearches.conf [<stanza name>] dispatch.earliest_time https://help.splunk.com/en/splunk-enterprise/administer/admin-manual/10.4/configuration-file-reference/10.4.0-configuration-file-reference/savedsearches.conf
vendor:          savedsearches.conf [<stanza name>] search https://help.splunk.com/en/splunk-enterprise/administer/admin-manual/10.4/configuration-file-reference/10.4.0-configuration-file-reference/savedsearches.conf
# --- end vendor verification

external:        The organization's on-demand reporting requirements - which reports are
                 required, over which fields, and for which recipients - which the check
                 text leaves organization-defined and no Splunk setting supplies
external:        Review of the report output by the responsible staff

citation:        SRG-APP-000181-AU-000200 (V-206483) check text;
                 savedsearches.conf.spec:44, 564-570; datamodels.conf.spec:29-40;
                 macros.conf.spec:52; metric_rollups.conf.spec:38-48
finding:         No saved report with a defined search string and dispatch window exists
                 over the audit data, so the application carries no configured audit
                 reduction to support the organization's on-demand reporting requirements.
